{"title":"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b51850ccd3440214d4ccfbc14d29b2a31bfda55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> donkeys in a sanctuary. Of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b51850ccd3440214d4ccfbc14d29b2a31bfda55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> donkeys, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab882f06ffcb3c014180cc9d883d5ddad1af1125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> are adults and the rest are babies. How many baby donkeys are there in the sanctuary?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Subtracting_Percentages.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Subtracting_Percentages)\">Solution 1 (Subtracting Percentages)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Subtracting Percentages)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab882f06ffcb3c014180cc9d883d5ddad1af1125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the donkeys are adults and the rest are babies, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/012f2827e62c38a39bf60e55f0563412efe9c930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 85\\% = 15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" /> of the donkeys are babies. This means that of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b51850ccd3440214d4ccfbc14d29b2a31bfda55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> donkeys, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/183ed7f1abd2176c345e4c8700d222297e432f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140 \\times 15\\% = 140 \\times \\frac{3}{20} = \\boxed{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"234\" height=\"38\" /> are babies.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Subtracting_from_Adults.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Subtracting_from_Adults)\">Solution 2 (Subtracting from Adults)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Subtracting from Adults)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab882f06ffcb3c014180cc9d883d5ddad1af1125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b51850ccd3440214d4ccfbc14d29b2a31bfda55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> donkeys are adults, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcf4761d4bfba0fb49a4bc81f2cb26d3a940f0c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140 \\times 85\\% = 140 \\times \\frac{17}{20} = 119$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"232\" height=\"38\" /> of the donkeys are adults. The rest of the donkeys are babies, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f2665ec89fe2ceb2082d62671fc52b88f584dff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140 - 119$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> of the donkeys are babies, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3866dbf1d954e409beb13f52f7ed7618bedc183f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC\" title=\"2025 CIMC\">2025 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017100913\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1246/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2205/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%